From 5efaa245f9b438028e07a4ca5b97b9ccde484896 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chris Johns <chrisj@rtems.org>
Date: Mon, 1 Aug 2022 16:08:50 -1000
Subject: [PATCH v4 2/2] rtems: Check NTP env variable each NTP get if set in
 boot script

- Remove NTP shadowed variables from the initialization

- Add a print of NVRAM values

- Include the Legacy stack header to pick up the NTP externals
---
 modules/libcom/RTEMS/posix/rtems_init.c       | 10 +--
 modules/libcom/RTEMS/setBootConfigFromNVRAM.c | 21 ++++++
 .../libcom/src/osi/os/RTEMS-posix/osdTime.cpp | 73 ++++++++++++++++++-
 3 files changed, 95 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)

